  "description": "Test 40: CheckConstraintTiles for a water-compatible 1 x 2 configuration on {30, 30, 30, 31}. A water record W (type 5, footprint (0, 16)-(16, 32)) covers city cell (30, 31) at facing 2 and (30, 30) at facing 0; it needs CellHasWater and not CellHasLand (else 5). A land record L (type 6, footprint (0, 0)-(16, 16)) on (30, 30) needs no water (else 6, which wins over 5). W with extra value 1 also needs the two-cell strip in front, r = (orientation + facing + 2) mod 4, in bounds and navigable, z outer: (30, 29), (30, 30) at facing 2, (30, 31), (30, 32) at facing 0; each row stops at its first failure.",
